title: Socks0
---
<<movePenny(80,123)>><<pennyKnitting(4)>>There's one sock done and one to go.
I remember reading about "Second Sock Syndrome",
the paralysis that kicks in when
you've finished one sock in a pair
and can't bring yourself to knit
the other. 
It's kind of like the "Boyfriend
Sweater Curse," where if you make
a guy a sweater he'll dump you 
before it's done. Always struck
me as pretty misogynistic...
<<endPennyKnitting()>>
===
